Title: A goal stays secret until its object knows
Structure: sequence

# Not Until You're Divorced

[[id: q1]]

INT. GIRLFRIEND'S FLAT - DAY

The WIFE and the GIRLFRIEND, tangled in a sheet. The Wife reaches for her; the Girlfriend holds her off.

GIRLFRIEND
Not until you're divorced.

WIFE
Then I'll tell him. Tonight.

# The Dinner

[[id: q2]]

INT. HOUSE - DINING ROOM - NIGHT

Candles. The HUSBAND carves. The Wife pours him a second glass and watches him drink it.

HUSBAND
You're in a good mood.

WIFE
I am.

WIFE (CONT'D)
I want a divorce.

The knife stops.
